  "descriptionHtml": "<h2 data-end=\"261\" data-start=\"222\"><strong data-end=\"261\" data-start=\"225\">Custom Lanyard with Badge Holder</strong></h2>\n<p data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"263\">Upgrade your event or workplace ID setup with our <strong data-end=\"332\" data-start=\"313\">Custom Lanyards</strong>, designed for durability, comfort, and professional branding. Perfect for trade shows, conferences, corporate events, staff IDs, and promotional giveaways, our lanyards combine functionality with high-impact customization.</p>\n<p data-end=\"740\" data-start=\"557\">Available in multiple widths and attachment options, these lanyards are fully customizable to match your brand and event needs \u2014 with <strong data-end=\"739\" data-start=\"691\">design, setup, and delivery already included</strong>.</p>\n<h3 data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"742\"><strong data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"746\">Key Features</strong></h3>\n<p data-end=\"1590\" data-start=\"764\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong data-end=\"792\" data-start=\"767\">Full Custom Printing:</strong> High-quality printing ensures your logo and artwork look sharp and professional.<br data-end=\"876\" data-start=\"873\">\ud83d\udccf <strong data-end=\"906\" data-start=\"879\">Multiple Width Options:</strong> Available in <strong data-end=\"926\" data-start=\"920\">1\"</strong>, <strong data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"928\">3/4\"</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"950\" data-start=\"942\">5/8\"</strong> to suit different styles and comfort preferences.<br data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"1000\">\ud83d\udd17 <strong data-end=\"1029\" data-start=\"1006\">Attachment Options:</strong> Choose from <strong data-end=\"1058\" data-start=\"1042\">lobster claw</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1076\" data-start=\"1060\">bulldog clip</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"1078\">J-hook</strong>, or <strong data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1093\">keyring</strong> attachments.<br data-end=\"1120\" data-start=\"1117\">\ud83d\udcaa <strong data-is-only-node=\"\" data-end=\"1149\" data-start=\"1123\">Durable &amp; Comfortable:</strong> Made from premium materials designed for all-day wear.<br data-end=\"1207\" data-start=\"1204\">\ud83e\udeaa <strong data-end=\"1228\" data-start=\"1210\">Versatile Use:</strong> Ideal for holding ID badges, access cards, keys, or event passes.<br data-end=\"1297\" data-start=\"1294\">\ud83e\uddef <strong data-end=\"1317\" data-start=\"1300\">Safety Ready:</strong> Breakaway option available for added safety in active environments.<br data-end=\"1388\" data-start=\"1385\">\ud83c\udf81 <strong data-end=\"1417\" data-start=\"1391\">All-Inclusive Pricing:</strong> <strong data-end=\"1474\" data-start=\"1418\">Setup fee, design service, and delivery are included</strong> \u2014 no hidden costs.<br data-end=\"1496\" data-start=\"1493\">\u23f1\ufe0f <strong data-end=\"1525\" data-start=\"1499\">Production Turnaround:</strong> Approximately <strong data-end=\"1551\" data-start=\"1540\">3 weeks</strong> from design approval and full payment.</p>\n<h3 data-end=\"1630\" data-start=\"1592\"><strong data-end=\"1630\" data-start=\"1596\">Why Choose Our Custom Lanyards</strong></h3>\n<p data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1632\">\u2714 Enhances brand visibility at events<br data-end=\"1672\" data-start=\"1669\">\u2714 Professional look for staff and attendees<br data-end=\"1718\" data-start=\"1715\">\u2714 Comfortable for extended wear<br data-end=\"1752\" data-start=\"1749\">\u2714 Reliable attachments for everyday use<br data-end=\"1794\" data-start=\"1791\">\u2714 Hassle-free ordering with full service included</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1850\" data-start=\"1847\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1873\" data-start=\"1852\"><strong data-end=\"1873\" data-start=\"1856\">Primary Usage</strong></h3>\n<p data-end=\"2011\" data-start=\"1875\">Trade shows, conferences, corporate events, employee IDs, schools, conventions, festivals, brand activations, and promotional giveaways.</p>",
  "descriptionText": "Custom Lanyard with Badge Holder\nUpgrade your event or workplace ID setup with our Custom Lanyards, designed for durability, comfort, and professional branding. Perfect for trade shows, conferences, corporate events, staff IDs, and promotional giveaways, our lanyards combine functionality with high-impact customization.\nAvailable in multiple widths and attachment options, these lanyards are fully customizable to match your brand and event needs \u2014 with design, setup, and delivery already included.\nKey Features\n\ud83c\udfa8 Full Custom Printing: High-quality printing ensures your logo and artwork look sharp and professional.\n\ud83d\udccf Multiple Width Options: Available in 1\", 3/4\", and 5/8\" to suit different styles and comfort preferences.\n\ud83d\udd17 Attachment Options: Choose from lobster claw, bulldog clip, J-hook, or keyring attachments.\n\ud83d\udcaa Durable & Comfortable: Made from premium materials designed for all-day wear.\n\ud83e\udeaa Versatile Use: Ideal for holding ID badges, access cards, keys, or event passes.\n\ud83e\uddef Safety Ready: Breakaway option available for added safety in active environments.\n\ud83c\udf81 All-Inclusive Pricing: Setup fee, design service, and delivery are included \u2014 no hidden costs.\n\u23f1\ufe0f Production Turnaround: Approximately 3 weeks from design approval and full payment.\nWhy Choose Our Custom Lanyards\n\u2714 Enhances brand visibility at events\n\u2714 Professional look for staff and attendees\n\u2714 Comfortable for extended wear\n\u2714 Reliable attachments for everyday use\n\u2714 Hassle-free ordering with full service included\nPrimary Usage\nTrade shows, conferences, corporate events, employee IDs, schools, conventions, festivals, brand activations, and promotional giveaways.",
